'''Years-End Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and can be unlocked when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the New Year gacha event and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]] grants [[Multi-Hit]] at the cost of a longer attack rate, and accelerates her cooldown.

{{Cat Info
